<title>HONG KONG: SGA sets call warrants on red-chip basket.</title>
<headline>SGA sets call warrants on red-chip basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV</p>
<p>(SGA) said on Thursday it had launched 200 million</p>
<p>American-style call warrants on a basket of five red-chip</p>
<p>stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd	     0.80 shrs</p>
<p> China Merchants Holdings (International)   0.80 shrs</p>
<p> COSCO Pacific Ltd				  1.10 shrs</p>
<p> China Everbright IHD Pacific Ltd	     0.90 shrs</p>
<p> Beijing Enterprises Holdings Ltd	     0.30 shrs</p>
<p>One hundred warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$105.90	PREMIUM	 28.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.302	 GEARING	 3.51x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 26.JUN.97	SETTLEMENT    CASH</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  26.JUN.98	BOARD LOT     50,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> PAYMENT DATE	THREE WEEKS AFTER ISSUE DATE.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
